"We consider a hardware-efficient `entangler map` for the TwoLocal circuit with periodic connectivity between the last and the first qubits of the `entangler map`. This long range interaction can lead to extra SWAP gates during transpilation, thus increasing the depth of the circuit.\n"
msgstr ""
